Z||000000||Tabs||08-26-2001||06:51 PM||||Member of the forum who live in the GTA where do you go to get your Fiero worked on Racetech or RSM???<P>I go to Racetech cuz I like the work they do and the people who work there are a bunch of great friendly people. ||||reg||5
Z||000001||grinthock||08-26-2001||10:10 PM||||I personally use RSM after having a bad experience at The Fiero Shop... They no longer sell to me after I accused them of something.  I now deal with RSM, they are kind, fast to get back to you, and seem to do quality work.  Try them out.  Seems that Race-Tech has changed their business model a fair bit.  BUT if they are workin for ya, keep going there.<p>[This message has been edited by grinthock (edited 08-27-2001).]||||reg||1
