Z||000004||grinthock||08-28-2001||10:59 PM||||Adrift:  In the parts Dept, YES they are both outrageous!  Shop around, on the service side NO!  Racetech is $55/hr that's cheap (But I heard rumors of an increase)<P>For parts call Straightline racing.<P>STRAIGHT LINE RACING<BR>22 MUNHAM GATE<BR>SCARBOROUGH, ON<BR>M1P 2B4<BR>(416)751-6652<P><BR>I highly recommend them, I got wires, a cap, coil and stuff there really inexpensive, they stock most stuff for Fiero's and the staff is great.<BR><P>------------------<BR> <A HREF="http://www.fieroworld.com" TARGET=_blank> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/fieroworldbanner.gif"> </A> <BR>Fieroworld!  Home of my 87 GT and 85 GT<BR>Justin C.<BR>Engineer, Designer and<BR>Technical Trainer for Nortel Networks Business Products.||||reg||1
